padding":"0px 12px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgb(122, 92, 168)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"I didn't find this in a book.\nI found it in the hardest\nyears of my life.","x":744,"y":4743,"w":510,"h":141.09375,"font":"700 42px / 47.04px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.47px","margin":"0px 0px 38px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(247, 240, 232)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"I built a successful international career at the United Nations — working alongside diplomats, leading people across different cultures, and changing my career ","x":744,"y":4922.09375,"w":426,"h":129.5625,"font":"18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"And it was. I also had a husband I love, two children growing up too fast, and aging parents who needed me. Every role I played, I gave it everything. What I di","x":744,"y":5063.65625,"w":426,"h":129.5625,"font":"18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's when I stopped looking for a better strategy and started understanding how my brain actually works. That search led me to neuroscience — and changed ever","x":744,"y":5205.21875,"w":426,"h":86.375,"font":"18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H3","cls":"","text":"I was doing everything\nright. And I still felt\ncompletely lost.","x":744,"y":5356.59375,"w":445,"h":141.09375,"font":"700 42px / 47.04px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.47px","margin":"65px 0px 37px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(247, 240, 232)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's the moment I understand better than any theory. It's not about not trying hard enough. It's about running a system that was never designed for this much ","x":744,"y":5534.6875,"w":406,"h":86.375,"font":"18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"The method based on the NeuroIntegration method by Katerina Lengold","x":113,"y":5842,"w":1029,"h":100,"font":"700 45px / 50px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 61px 3px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(40, 40, 40)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"The NeuroIntegration method was developed by Katerina Lengold, founder of the California Institute of Neurointegration.","x":112,"y":6009,"w":418,"h":64.78125,"font":"900 18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"900","letterSpacing":"-0.15px","margin":"0px 0px 11px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(42, 42, 42)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"It combines neuroscience, psychology, and behavioural science into a practical coaching framework that works with how your brain is actually wired. NeuroSprints","x":112,"y":6084.78125,"w":491,"h":107.96875,"font":"18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 18px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(90, 85, 102)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"ACT · NEUROSPRINT\nUse neuroscience-informed planning cycles to reach goals without burnout.","x":1059,"y":6050,"w":285,"h":57,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"THINK · NEUROSURFING\nRewire habitual thought patterns, reduce cognitive rigidity, and build creative thinking.","x":1059,"y":6142,"w":285,"h":57,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"FEEL · NEUROBALANCE\nTrain your nervous system to recover faster from stress and stay emotionally balanced.","x":1059,"y":6269,"w":285,"h":57,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"Is this you?\nYou might be in the right place if...","x":112,"y":6468,"w":1218,"h":100,"font":"700 45px / 50px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 54px 2px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(40, 40, 40)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're exhausted but can't slow down\nYou keep pushing through — but the energy just isn't there anymore.","x":110,"y":6618,"w":588,"h":105,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"24px 25px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're facing a big change\nNew country, new role, new chapter — and you don't know\nwhere to start.","x":110,"y":6767,"w":586,"h":123,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"22px 25px 24px 26px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You feel stuck but don't know why\nYou've tried changing things — jobs, habits, routines. Nothing fully clicks.","x":110,"y":6933,"w":586,"h":125,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"23px 25px 24px 21px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You've been putting yourself last\nEveryone else comes first. You've lost track of what you actually want.","x":745,"y":6618,"w":598,"h":104,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"24px 25px 24px 23px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You know you're capable of more\nBut something keeps getting in the way — and you're ready to find\nout what.","x":744,"y":6767,"w":598,"h":123,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"22px 25px 24px 27px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're doing everything right — still feel empty\nOn paper it looks good. Inside, something is missing.","x":744,"y":6933,"w":598,"h":125,"font":"16px / 24.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"24px 25px 24px 21px","color":"rgb(91, 86, 105)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"site-section-title","text":"Reviews","x":110,"y":7319,"w":1224,"h":66.296875,"font":"700 65.1px / 66.3px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 56.7px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"Working with Ksenia helped me understand the real reasons behind my procrastination. I became more self-aware and grateful. I feel calmer now, and my anxiety ha","x":139,"y":7586.078125,"w":409,"h":166.15625,"font":"18px / 21.6px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"25.5px 0px 0px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","c